          <p><strong>Archetype:</strong> READ_VIEW | <strong>Version:</strong> v1.0.0 | <strong>Gate A:</strong> READY_FOR_DEV | <strong>Digest:</strong> <code>SRD-F001-7664AEEC0434</code></p>
